{"unit_id":"menghuanshiguang__devctl-dsh#card-zh","repo":"menghuanshiguang/devctl-dsh","commit":"51631ad08b178c5008d2e504e0fb75bd113e0816","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"devctl-dsh 是用于跨设备控制 DSH 的插件，包含 Host 端服务和 dshctl 命令行控制端。它在 DSH 中开启令牌认证的 TCP 接口，并可提供局域网网页代理和设置页配对面板。主要功能包括查看及创建会话、发送文本或图片消息并接收流式事件、切换模型和操作排队消息，以及从手机回应审批和提问。适合希望在手机或另一台电脑上继续操作 DSH 的用户；需要安装控制端并使用配对令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:92-107","index.js:442-610","client.js:427-431"]}
{"unit_id":"menghuanshiguang__devctl-dsh#card-en","repo":"menghuanshiguang/devctl-dsh","commit":"51631ad08b178c5008d2e504e0fb75bd113e0816","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"devctl-dsh lets users control DSH sessions from another device with the dshctl CLI. It provides a token-authenticated TCP connection and optional LAN web proxy. Paired devices can list or create sessions, send text and images, follow replies, manage queues, and answer approvals.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:92-107","index.js:442-610","client.js:427-431"]}
