{"unit_id":"menghuanshiguang__devctl-dsh#caveat-1","repo":"menghuanshiguang/devctl-dsh","commit":"51631ad08b178c5008d2e504e0fb75bd113e0816","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"devctl-dsh 会在 Host 上开启控制端口，令牌状态写入 DSH_HOME 下的 devctl-dsh.json；局域网网页代理默认也开启，可通过 web.port 设为 0 关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:92-107","index.js:263-279","cordis.patch.yml:4-9"]}
